        1473,
        811
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, real property taxes are an important component of a local government's tax base and are essential to quality service delivery; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2615,
