      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) The Commission shall consist of two Chairpersons, Vicki Been and Marc V. Shaw, six members, Allen P. Cappelli, Carol O'Cleireacain, Kenneth J. Knuckles, James Parrott, Gary Rodney and Elizabeth Velez, and such other members as may be appointed. The Commission shall further include as non-voting ex-officio members the Commissioner of Finance, the Director of Management and Budget, the Director of the City Council Finance Division and the Deputy Director and Chief Economist of the City Council Finance Division.",
